Package: ManifoldCausal
Type: Package
Title: Causal Inference with Manifold-Valued Treatments and Outcomes
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Your Name", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "your.email@ynu.edu.cn"),
    person("Coauthor 1", role = "aut"),
    person("Coauthor 2", role = "aut"))
Description: Implements the manifold kernel instrumental variable (MKIV) estimator
    and geodesic local average treatment effect (G-LATE) for shape-valued
    treatments and outcomes. The methods are based on nonparametric IV techniques
    extended to Riemannian manifolds, using Procrustes alignment, heat kernels,
    and Fréchet means. Provides functions for shape alignment, distance matrix
    calculation, MKIV estimation, cross-validation, structural function
    visualization, and G-LATE identification. Includes example road network
    shape data from four Chinese cities.
